{
  "id": "density__specific_weight__and_specific_gravity___d",
  "title": "Density, Specific Weight, and Specific Gravity Calculator",
  "description": "Calculate density, specific gravity, and specific weight of substances. Includes formulas for mass per unit volume, relative density compared to water or air, and weight per unit volume.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Density Calculator\n\n**Density** is mass per unit volume (ρ = m / V). Choose your calculation type below.",
      "headers": []
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "calc_type",
          "label": "Calculation Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "density",
              "label": "Density (ρ = m / V)"
            },
            {
              "value": "mass",
              "label": "Mass (m = ρ × V)"
            },
            {
              "value": "volume",
              "label": "Volume (V = m / ρ)"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "density"
        },
        {
          "id": "mass_kg",
          "label": "Mass",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "volume_m3",
          "label": "Volume",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m³",
          "defaultValue": 1
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "density_result",
          "label": "Density",
          "formula": "inputs.mass_kg / inputs.volume_m3",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Specific Gravity Calculator\n\n**Specific Gravity (SG)** is the ratio of substance density to water density (dimensionless).\n\nFor liquids/solids: SG = ρ_substance / ρ_water\n\nFor gases: SG = ρ_gas / ρ_air",
      "headers": []
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "sg_type",
          "label": "Specific Gravity Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "liquid",
              "label": "Liquid/Solid (vs Water)"
            },
            {
              "value": "gas",
              "label": "Gas (vs Air)"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "liquid"
        },
        {
          "id": "substance_density",
          "label": "Substance Density",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "reference_density",
          "label": "Reference Density (Water: 1000 kg/m³, Air: 1.204 kg/m³)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "sg_result",
          "label": "Specific Gravity",
          "formula": "inputs.substance_density / inputs.reference_density",
          "unit": "",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Specific Weight Calculator\n\n**Specific Weight (γ)** is weight (force) per unit volume: γ = ρ × g\n\nwhere g = 9.807 m/s² (SI) or 32.174 ft/s² (Imperial)",
      "headers": []
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "density_sw",
          "label": "Density",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 1000
        },
        {
          "id": "gravity",
          "label": "Gravity Acceleration",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m/s²",
          "defaultValue": 9.807
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "sw_result",
          "label": "Specific Weight",
          "formula": "inputs.density_sw * inputs.gravity",
          "unit": "N/m³",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "sw_kn",
          "label": "Specific Weight (kN/m³)",
          "formula": "(inputs.density_sw * inputs.gravity) / 1000",
          "unit": "kN/m³",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
